        "question1": "What is the referral membership program?",
        "answer1": "The referral membership program is a partnership marketing model. When you recommend new users to register and use our services through your exclusive invitation link or referral code, you can earn corresponding commission rewards. This is equivalent to becoming our brand promotion partner and earning additional income by sharing our services.",
        "question2": "How is my bonus calculated?",
        "answer2": "Your bonus is mainly calculated based on the consumption amount of users you invite, specifically including the following aspects: 1. Direct invitation reward: When users you directly invite complete their first purchase, you will receive a fixed percentage of the order amount as a reward. 2. Indirect invitation reward: When users you invite then invite others to make purchases, you can also receive a certain percentage as a secondary reward. 3. Tiered bonuses: As the number of people you invite increases, your bonus percentage will increase accordingly. 4. Additional achievement rewards: Complete specific promotion goals to earn extra bonuses.",
        "question3": "How to promote for free?",
        "answer3": "You can promote for free through the following methods: 1. Social media sharing: Share your exclusive invitation link on platforms like WeChat Moments, Weibo, Xiaohongshu, etc. 2. Content creation: Share usage experiences by writing review articles, making tutorial videos, etc. 3. Word-of-mouth recommendations: Directly recommend to friends, family, or colleagues, sharing your invitation code. 4. Community participation: Share valuable content in relevant forums and communities with your invitation information attached. 5. Personal network: Promote using your professional circles, interest groups, and other social networks.",
